14. LSA Protection / RunAsPPL
ATSB found LSA Protection disabled.     ATSB SOE Penetration Test Repor…
Run:
reg query "HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa" /v RunAsPPL

Also:
reg query "HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa" /v RunAsPPLBoot

PowerShell:
Get-ItemProperty "HKLM:\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa" |
Select-Object RunAsPPL,RunAsPPLBoot

Typical interpretation:
RunAsPPL 1 = enabled with UEFI variable
RunAsPPL 2 = enabled without UEFI variable
missing/0 = not configured

Also check event logs if accessible:
Get-WinEvent -FilterHashtable @{
    LogName='System'
    Id=12
} -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue |
Select-Object -First 10

